WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:33.958
<b>This is the final verse of the second chapter</b>

2
00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:39.458
<b>Here, Krishna is describing the glory </b>
<b>of a person with steady wisdom.</b>

3
00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:47.833
<b>Krishna says that being steadfast in wisdom</b>

4
00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:50.250
<b>is the state of supreme knowledge.</b>

5
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:54.708
<b>And the impact of such a state </b>
<b>extends not only through life</b>

6
00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:58.333
<b>but also beyond death.</b>

7
00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:00.625
<b>In the living state, such a person</b>

8
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:07.083
<b>remains protected from all the illusions </b>
<b>and entanglements of this world.</b>

9
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:11.791
<b>After death, this person attains Brahma-nirvana,</b>

10
00:01:11.791 --> 00:01:17.333
<b>which is spiritually a blissful </b>
<b>and eternal state of existence.</b>

11
00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:19.875
<b>Whatever the worldly circumstance,</b>

12
00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:22.833
<b>whether life or death,</b>

13
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:26.416
<b>being steadfast in wisdom is indeed supreme.</b>

14
00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:36.625
<b>Many times in life, humans experience confusion.</b>

15
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:44.666
<b>Try to remember when you felt most </b>
<b>confused and worried in life.</b>

16
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:45.625
<b>Perhaps</b>

17
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:49.291
<b>some past sorrow weighed heavily,</b>

18
00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:51.375
<b>the present wasn't clear,</b>

19
00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:54.875
<b>or some future fear haunted you.</b>

20
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:58.208
<b>How disturbing was that state.</b>

21
00:01:58.208 --> 00:01:59.333
<b>Now</b>

22
00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:10.333
<b>consider that for many, even more difficult </b>
<b>than this challenging state is the moment</b>

23
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:15.000
<b>when death stands before them.</b>

24
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.041
<b>In such a state, nothing makes sense –</b>

25
00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:22.458
<b>where will one go from here,</b>

26
00:02:22.458 --> 00:02:26.000
<b>what happens after death,</b>

27
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.958
<b>guilt over life's mistakes,</b>

28
00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:30.958
<b>or</b>

29
00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:36.666
<b>regret over unfulfilled desires.</b>

30
00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:42.458
<b>All sorrows, all confusions surround at once.</b>

31
00:02:42.458 --> 00:02:44.125
<b>But</b>

32
00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:48.875
<b>one who is spiritually fully developed</b>

33
00:02:48.875 --> 00:02:56.916
<b>remains undisturbed not just by life's problems, </b>
<b>but even by this condition of death.</b>

34
00:02:56.916 --> 00:03:01.208
<b>Even in this state, their mind remains clear,</b>

35
00:03:01.208 --> 00:03:04.166
<b>peaceful.</b>

36
00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:06.708
<b>Why?</b>

37
00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:10.041
<b>Because death is a certain truth,</b>

38
00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:11.916
<b>it had to come.</b>

39
00:03:11.916 --> 00:03:19.333
<b>A spiritually developed person keeps</b>
<b>themselves prepared even for this state.</b>

40
00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:20.625
<b>Not only this,</b>

41
00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:28.375
<b>they have prepared themselves for </b>
<b>the journey that comes after death.</b>

42
00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:32.833
<b>How liberating is this thought,</b>

43
00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.666
<b>where in life</b>

44
00:03:34.666 --> 00:03:36.333
<b>or death – </b>

45
00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:41.833
<b>there's no place for confusion or worry.  </b>

46
00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:45.833
<b>If there is anything, it's only clarity,</b>

47
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:48.791
<b>only peace.</b>

48
00:03:48.791 --> 00:03:51.916
<b>Are you preparing yourself?</b>

49
00:03:51.916 --> 00:03:57.125
<b>Or are you still entangled </b>
<b>in worldly complications? </b>

50
00:03:57.125 --> 00:03:58.958
<b>Don't worry,</b>

51
00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:01.958
<b>this very moment, this very place is excellent</b>

52
00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:06.416
<b>to begin your spiritual journey.</b>

53
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:08.458
<b>Begin.</b>

54
00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:13.833
<b>And know that every traveler on this path</b>

55
00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:20.666
<b>will find me as their guide alongside them.</b>

56
00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:29.083
<b>Humans take great interest in making plans.</b>

57
00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:31.375
<b>Whether it's their financial situation,</b>

58
00:04:31.375 --> 00:04:32.875
<b>business,</b>

59
00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:34.166
<b>family,</b>

60
00:04:34.166 --> 00:04:37.291
<b>or even small expenses,</b>

61
00:04:37.291 --> 00:04:43.041
<b>they try to accomplish </b>
<b>everything in a planned way.</b>

62
00:04:43.041 --> 00:04:45.000
<b>But amidst all this,</b>

63
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:51.083
<b>they ignore life's most unshakeable truth.</b>

64
00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:53.916
<b>Death.</b>

65
00:04:53.916 --> 00:05:01.291
<b>They neither prepare for </b>
<b>death nor make any plans for it.</b>

66
00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:06.208
<b>Rather, they avoid this subject entirely.</b>

67
00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:07.666
<b>But</b>

68
00:05:07.666 --> 00:05:12.083
<b>will running away change this truth?</b>

69
00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:14.333
<b>The final time must come,</b>

70
00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:19.583
<b>when everything earned in </b>
<b>this world will remain here.</b>

71
00:05:19.583 --> 00:05:22.791
<b>No worldly plan will help,</b>

72
00:05:22.791 --> 00:05:26.166
<b>nor any possession.</b>

73
00:05:26.166 --> 00:05:28.791
<b>If anything will help then,</b>

74
00:05:28.791 --> 00:05:32.166
<b>it's this spiritual knowledge,</b>

75
00:05:32.166 --> 00:05:34.250
<b>which will assist not just throughout life,</b>

76
00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.333
<b>but</b>

77
00:05:35.333 --> 00:05:38.666
<b>also in death's decisive moment.</b>

78
00:05:38.666 --> 00:05:41.916
<b>No one expects death,</b>

79
00:05:41.916 --> 00:05:42.833
<b>but</b>

80
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:47.041
<b>this truth cannot be ignored either.</b>

81
00:05:47.041 --> 00:05:53.833
<b>Wouldn't it be better to</b>
<b>simplify both life and death?</b>

82
00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:58.333
<b>Wouldn't it be better to adopt the spiritual path,</b>

83
00:05:58.333 --> 00:05:59.375
<b>and</b>

84
00:05:59.375 --> 00:06:04.208
<b>inspire others to walk it too?</b>

85
00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:10.000
<b>Rush,</b>

86
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.208
<b>competition,</b>

87
00:06:11.208 --> 00:06:17.333
<b>taking advantage of not just situations</b>
<b>but people for self-interest – </b>

88
00:06:17.333 --> 00:06:23.791
<b>many consider this the truth of professional life.</b>

89
00:06:23.791 --> 00:06:26.916
<b>In such an environment, one who</b>
<b>maintains steady wisdom,</b>

90
00:06:26.916 --> 00:06:30.416
<b>remains calm in exciting situations,</b>

91
00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:33.416
<b>responds to insult with a smile,</b>

92
00:06:33.416 --> 00:06:37.083
<b>doesn't take unnecessary advantage of others –</b>

93
00:06:37.083 --> 00:06:43.375
<b>such a person is mistakenly</b>
<b>considered foolish by many.</b>

94
00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:44.208
<b>But</b>

95
00:06:44.208 --> 00:06:46.333
<b>the truth is,</b>

96
00:06:46.333 --> 00:06:52.875
<b>that person is more aware, more </b>
<b>clear about their life than others.</b>

97
00:06:52.875 --> 00:06:56.458
<b>For them, excitement, insults, competition –</b>

98
00:06:56.458 --> 00:07:01.458
<b>all these are signs of straying from the goal.</b>

99
00:07:01.458 --> 00:07:04.666
<b>They give no reaction to these.</b>

100
00:07:04.666 --> 00:07:09.750
<b>Where others consider these </b>
<b>the truth of professional life,</b>

101
00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:16.958
<b>a person of steady wisdom progresses </b>
<b>toward their goal with concentration.</b>

102
00:07:16.958 --> 00:07:22.125
<b>Where professional life's difficult </b>
<b>circumstances confuse others,</b>

103
00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:26.458
<b>this person remains far above confusion.</b>

104
00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:29.083
<b>Remember two things:</b>

105
00:07:29.083 --> 00:07:30.125
<b>First -</b>

106
00:07:30.125 --> 00:07:35.625
<b>It's not necessary to make </b>
<b>noise about goal achievement,</b>

107
00:07:35.625 --> 00:07:40.583
<b>take advantage of others, </b>
<b>or remain constantly excited.</b>

108
00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:43.166
<b>Avoid this notion.</b>

109
00:07:43.166 --> 00:07:44.541
<b>Second –</b>

110
00:07:44.541 --> 00:07:50.041
<b>Spirituality itself is completely </b>
<b>capable of goal achievement.</b>

111
00:07:50.041 --> 00:07:51.916
<b>It will give you clarity,</b>

112
00:07:51.916 --> 00:07:53.583
<b>concentration.</b>

113
00:07:53.583 --> 00:07:55.625
<b>Will lead you toward the goal.</b>

114
00:07:55.625 --> 00:07:59.208
<b>Remain on your spiritual journey.</b>

